## 4. AI-Generated Output

ORVYN may generate source code, text, recommendations, configurations, documents, images, analyses, commands, plans, or other output using artificial intelligence systems.

Subject to applicable law and third-party rights, Kernel AI Labs does not claim ownership of AI-generated output created specifically for you through your use of ORVYN.

